        <mxCell id="6YV4Dj9RcrDZxb3AhdDE-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=#143642;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Patching Policy&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;Trivy reports run every month on a set date.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Review Trivy report Identify High Crit , Med Crit from the report to target ( monitor)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monthly dnf update runs after theTrivy report date .&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trivy report runs again after DNF update &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We review how many of the High Crit / Med Crit /Low crit got resolved.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;**The review workflow can be a LLM repetable task that runs if it makes this easier. ( Seems to be suitable )&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
